Package: wafcstudies
Type: Compendium
Title: Reproducible Simulation Study for Wavelet Additive Functional
    Coefficients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michel H.", "Montoril", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "michel@ufscar.br")
Description: Research compendium for the simulation study of the article on
    regression with additive functional coefficients estimated by a block
    lasso on wavelet bases (WAFC). It simulates the study designs, fits the
    WAFC estimator and its competitors, and writes the tables reported in
    the article and its supplementary material. This DESCRIPTION declares
    the dependencies for 'renv'; the compendium is not a package to be
    installed.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6)
Imports:
    WaveBased,
    glmnet,
    Matrix,
    grpreg,
    mgcv,
    VCBART,
    yaml
Remotes:
    github::michelcias/WaveBased
